      "content": "but even if i try to start over, the silence is just... deafening. everything i do now feels fake. it’s like i’m a ghost haunting my own life. i'm just going through the motions, eating, sleeping, staring at screens... but the person who actually felt alive is gone. what's even the point of staying in this body if the soul of it has already disappeared?",
